### Additional Endpoints

#### Assign Content to Device (Direct)
```http
POST /api/devices/{device_id}/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content_id": 5,
  "display_order": 1,
  "is_active": true
}
```

#### Assign Content to Tag
```http
POST /api/tags/{tag_id}/content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content_id": 8,
  "display_order": 1,
  "is_active": true
}
```

#### Bulk Assign Content
```http
POST /api/content/{content_id}/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "device_ids": [1, 2, 3],
  "tag_ids": [5, 6],
  "display_order": 1
}
```

